{"reviews":[{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-0","r":5.0,"t":"Hand size","x":"Love it great size! Large dish I personally use for monomer (acrylic liquid) will buy again if available.","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-1","r":4.0,"t":"Be careful opening the package!","x":"Be careful opening the package! This was packaged in a tiny box & then the box was put in a bubble packing slip. The box wasn\u2019t taped or sealed properly so when I opened it, the lid fell out & almost hit the floor....luckily I caught it before then. Other than poor packaging, this is very cute and didn\u2019t take very long to arrive.  I\u2019m using this as a dappen dish for my monomer so I\u2019m happy I\u2019ve got something cute with a lid! It\u2019s not too big but not too small either. I recommend for those lookin","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-2","r":1.0,"t":"Came broken in pieces","x":"Terrible :( came broken! What a waste! It doesn\u2019t make sense to send glass packaged cheaply!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-3","r":1.0,"t":"HORRIBLE","x":"HORRIBLE ARROVED BROKEN AND MISSING THE Top !!! NEVER AGAIN ! This is horrible","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-4","r":5.0,"t":"I love the quality and the fast shipping service!","x":"I love it it\u2019s the perfect size to hold any amount of acrylic liquid that you need for doing your nails!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-5","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"Amazing. Good quality. Perfect big size.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-6","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size!","x":"I ordered these (ordered 2) to use for my monomer and acrylic powder. I didn't like how small the bowl (size that comes in the Kiss Acrylic kit) I purchased from Sally's. I searched amazon until I came across this nice little bowl w/ lid ,  and at an amazingly low price.  I was so amazed at the quality of this dappen dish and at how sparkly it is. I only paid $6.99 +tax each for these dappening dishes.  Will recommend.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-7","r":1.0,"t":"Didn\u2019t come with a top.","x":"Literally just opened this and its Missing the top?!?!?! It\u2019s supposed to come with a top that\u2019s the only reason I picked this one! So pissed.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-8","r":5.0,"t":"Adorable!","x":"Perfect size. I bought to use for acrylic monomer and powders. So adorable i bought a second one. Packaged very well and both arrived early. Not a scratch on them. I love them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-9","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size.","x":"These are the perfect shape and size for my acrylic monomer.  Not too big or too small.  These arrived in perfect condition.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-10","r":5.0,"t":"Not tiny","x":"its not tiny like those other monomer glasses. A good size. Mine didn't come broken. No missing pieces. I use it to store the acrylic powder because I wanted to create a color. Perfect for that.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-11","r":5.0,"t":"\ud83d\ude0d","x":"[[VIDEOID:1fb0f12d2b8adfed11201397e2c23695]] I love it. Mine came in one piece didnt have any problems at all. \ud83d\ude42","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-12","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size","x":"I love this it's exactly what I needed. Much bigger than the average dappen dish","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-13","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size for me!","x":"I use for acrylic nails. Sold individually. 1 dish with 1 lid. I have purchased 4.  I do not like the tiny dappen dishes. I have to use my left hand to do my nails on my right. Using the small ones with my non-dominant hand is impossible. These are the perfect size in my opinion. I don't fill it very full because that would be a huge waste. The bottom is a large enough diameter that it doesn't wobble when I release liquid from the brush on the side of the dish.  These are heavy and probably hold","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-14","r":4.0,"t":"Happy!","x":"Haven\u2019t used yet but just by looking at it I\u2019m very happy with it.  Super affordable, not tiny like others you find on this site.  Simple, but cute and should hold plenty of monomer  (The random small piece of wax paper when opening the box threw me but otherwise really 0 complaints)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-15","r":5.0,"t":"PERFECT FOR MONOMER !!","x":"Absolutely PERFECT! It\u2019s just as large as it looks in the photo! This thing holds damn near 3oz of monomer !!! It arrived carefully packaged (so breaking while opening is pretty impossible. There were NO blemishes, scratches or chips at all what so ever!!!! I am incredibly pleased !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-16","r":5.0,"t":"Good purchase!","x":"It wasn\u2019t packaged very well but it must be sturdy because it wasn\u2019t chipped or anything. Shipping took four days, which was a nice surprise. It\u2019s REALLY cute and I\u2019m glad I ordered it because my acetone was evaporating too quickly in the wider dish I had without a lid.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-17","r":2.0,"t":"It's Ok","x":"My package arrived open and without a lid!! I already had to wait a month and a half to get it along with some other items.... Now I'm pretty sure I have to wait for a new one to come again. Other than that it's ok for the most part, I guess.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-18","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect size","x":"I just received my dappen dish today. It is the perfect size for my monomer and acrylic powders. The dish is not too small nor too large. It is JUST RIGHT. The package was very secured with Newspaper, bubble wrap, and packed in small boxes.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-19","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"I was surprised coming back to the comments to see pretty much everyone else had the same experience. The package came in looking like it had been through hell. There was a tear on the side and I'm assuming that where my top went missing.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-20","r":1.0,"t":"GET IT TOGETHER!!!!","x":"I would of loved this product if it would of came complete!!!! It was missing the lid and honestly the inconvenience of just having to print a label and go through the whole returning and waiting for the product again.. not cool!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-21","r":1.0,"t":"NO LID !","x":"I had gotten this dappen dish Bcs it was so cute AND had a lid. I was so excited , then disappointed soo fast. I would go w a different dappen dish if you really need the lid. This is not the one.  Listen to all the reviews !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-22","r":5.0,"t":"Pretty","x":"It\u2019s a very pretty glass and I\u2019m glad everything came intact. I use this for my monomer and slip solution since I do polygel and acrylics, I recommend this if you want a new monomer glass.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-23","r":5.0,"t":"Great for nails!","x":"I got this little dish for doing my nails and for working with paint. It\u2019s a great size, the lid is nice at blocking fumes and it seems like it wouldn\u2019t break if dropped on carpet.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B00CLXXXH6-24","r":4.0,"t":"Not bad","x":"The lid was outside of the box once I opened the amazon bag, and smelled like acrylic liquid like it maybe had been used, but the size is great and it did not chip anywhere.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the size, describing it as large or perfect for holding acrylic monomer and powder, and noting it is bigger than typical dappen dishes.","cites":[1,5,6,7,9,10,11,13,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the item arrived broken or in pieces.","cites":[3,4]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the lid or top was missing from their order.","cites":[4,8]},{"text":"Reviewers comment positively on quality and appearance, calling it cute, adorable, and good quality.","cites":[2,6,9,12,15]},{"text":"Packaging experiences vary, with some reporting poor packaging and others saying it was packaged well and arrived in perfect condition.","cites":[2,3,9,10,12]}]},"qa":[]}